{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04250","headline":"晚度天山有怀京邑 · 骆宾王","name":"晚度天山有怀京邑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽上天山路，依然想物华。\n云疑上苑叶，雪似御沟花。\n行叹戎麾远，坐怜衣带赊。\n交河浮绝塞，弱水浸流沙。\n旅思徒漂梗，归期未及瓜。\n宁知心断绝，夜夜泣胡笳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}